This opportunity represents a **Conditional Fit**. There is a sharp divergence between the strategic potential and operational reality: while the "AI Factory" model aligns with PASHA's capital deployment goals and offers the only scalable return profile, the organization fundamentally lacks the technical DNA and sales channels to execute it. Consequently, success is viable only if PASHA bridges this "Capability-Ambition Mismatch" through a specialized Joint Venture and secures a government-backed power tariff to neutralize the 20–30% regional cost disadvantage.

